'''Copper''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 1]] or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Copper’s blade and guard both use a shiny copper brown coloring, along with small black screws seen on the blade’s fuller, and the guard’s quillon. The handle is solid black with these three shiny copper stripes entwining it.

== Trivia ==

* There was a knife named "Copper" in the [[MLG Box|MLG box]]. This "Copper" was then named to "[[Brown]]" and was moved to the [[Rainbow Box]]. It is now no longer obtainable from the Rainbow Box.

